msgctxt "1316"
msgid ""
"Thank you for shopping with us. Pardon me, sir, but you wouldn't happen to "
"be looking for any foreign brands, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1328"
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1340"
msgid "Well, every two months, we travel to Europe to purchase name-brand goods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1352"
msgid ""
"If you make a reservation with us for certain foreign brands, we will "
"purchase them for you in Europe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1364"
msgid ""
"They've got lots of fancy handbags over there that you can't get over here "
"in Japan, so if you're hoping to get your hands on one, just let us know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1376"
msgid ""
"(You can make special reservations for the fanciest European brands, huh? I "
"should remember this when I'm over at a cabaret club.)"
